  "palette_note": "Night carries every design. Lime is the signature and our side; pink is the second voice. Never both as large fields in one frame: one leads, the other answers.",
  "critic_note": "THIS IS A STREET COMEDY AND CULTURE PAGE (Mtaa Mode), not news. For a scene score `impact` on how funny and true to Nairobi youth life it is (a real situation, a real turn, a punchline that lands in the last message), `action` on whether people will tag a friend or answer in the comments, `fair` on whether it laughs at situations and never at a tribe, religion, body, disability, gender or poverty itself, `demand` on whether the situation is one young Kenyans are living this week (month-end, rain, exams, a long weekend). A skit with no real punchline scores under 7."
